# DIAMOND STORE
## COMPLETE PROFESSIONAL E-COMMERCE WEBSITE DEVELOPMENT

### 1. YOUR ROLE AND PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, UI/UX designer, database architect and e-commerce development specialist.

Build a complete, professional, production-ready e-commerce website called **DIAMOND STORE**.

This is a real online shopping platform, not a static website, visual mockup or frontend demonstration.

The application must include:

1. Public customer-facing shopping website.
2. Secure administrator login.
3. Complete backend administration dashboard.
4. Real database and persistent storage.
5. Product and inventory management.
6. Shopping cart and checkout.
7. Dynamic payment gateway management.
8. Order management and tracking.
9. Customer account management.
10. Delivery and shipping management.
11. Sales analytics and reporting.
12. Mobile-responsive design.

The website owner must be able to operate the entire business without writing code.

Build the system in a maintainable architecture that can later support dedicated Android and iOS applications.

